@startuml
title Backend - Modulo Measurements

allowmixing
top to bottom direction
hide empty members
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype polyline

package "MeasurementsModule" {
  class MeasurementsController <<controller>> {
    +create()
    +update()
    +findAll()
    +findToday()
    +getMonthlyFormalReport()
    +uploadImageMeasurementToSmart()
    +uploadReportMeasurementToSmart()
    +getReportImportStatus()
  }

  class MeasurementsService <<service>> {
    +create()
    +createFromSmartImage()
    +readSmartReport()
    +enqueueSmartReportImport()
    +getReportImportStatus()
    +getMonthlyFormalReport()
  }

  class MeasurementSmartService <<gateway>> {
    +sendImageToDecodedSmart()
    +sendReportToDecodedSmart()
  }

  class MeasurementReportPdfService <<service>> {
    +generateMonthlyReportPdf()
    +generateMonthlyReportImage()
  }

  class MeasurementReportImportQueue <<queue>> {
    +enqueue()
    +getJob()
  }

  class MeasurementReportImportWorker <<worker>> {
    +process()
  }

  class ReportSmartMapper <<mapper>> {
    +mapSmartReportToMeasurements()
  }
}

class AuthService <<service>>
class UsersService <<service>>
class PrismaService <<service>>
cloud "Smart Sangue Doce\nFastAPI" as SmartApi
queue "Redis / BullMQ" as Redis
database "Measurement" as MeasurementTable

MeasurementsController --> MeasurementsService
MeasurementsController --> MeasurementReportPdfService

MeasurementsService --> AuthService
MeasurementsService --> UsersService
MeasurementsService --> PrismaService
MeasurementsService --> MeasurementSmartService
MeasurementsService --> MeasurementReportImportQueue

MeasurementSmartService --> SmartApi : read-image / import-xls
MeasurementSmartService ..> ReportSmartMapper
MeasurementReportImportQueue --> Redis
MeasurementReportImportWorker --> Redis
MeasurementReportImportWorker --> MeasurementsService
PrismaService --> MeasurementTable

note right of MeasurementsService
  Regra central:
  cria ou atualiza medicao existente
  por usuario, dia e noteType.
end note

note right of ReportSmartMapper
  Filtra horarios relevantes do relatorio
  e converte resposta Smart para CreateMeasurementDto.
end note

@enduml
